Subject: [PATCH 2/3] SITL: CP Models rover and fixed-wing with the cpvehicle
 model

fly_auto.py flies and checks AUTO missions (rover: 20 m square; plane:
runway takeoff, circuit, landing). cpvehicle_rover.parm and
cpvehicle_plane.parm set servo ranges and the vehicle-specific values from
the models' parameters. README: run instructions, floating-point traps,
measured results.
